# From your store's admin → Settings → Developers. Use ONE of these.
#
# Recommended: a private key (esk_prv_…) with catalog:read, content:read,
# cart:write and checkout:write. This starter only calls the API from the
# server, so the key never reaches the browser.
ESTACKLY_PRIVATE_KEY=

# Or a public key (esk_pub_…) with the same permissions. Public keys are also
# limited per visitor IP, and here every request comes from your server's IP,
# so expect 429s under real traffic.
# ESTACKLY_PUBLIC_KEY=

# Optional: point at another API host while testing.
# ESTACKLY_API_URL=https://api.estackly.com/storefront/v1
